      <h2 id="story-title">Why Freeland exists</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:26px">Kevin started Freeland on a plain belief: a business deserves marketing run by someone who treats it like their own.</p>
      <p>He works directly with each client. There is no account manager in between, and no junior team running your campaigns. When you hire Freeland, you talk to Kevin.</p>
      <p>Kevin makes the calls. The system runs the repeat work: daily ad checks, scheduled sale changes and the weekly read. When it flags something that needs judgment, a person looks at it and decides.</p>
      <p>Today that work is pointed at founder-led DTC brands: Kevin starts with your public store and ads plus your five application answers, then ranks the leaks. A deeper review of account performance needs view-only access. The system does the repeat work.</p>
      <p>Find Kevin on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevinfreelandaiautomationandmarketingexpert/">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@kevin_freeland">TikTok</a>.</p>
      <figure style="margin-top:56px">
        <blockquote class="pull-quote">&ldquo;We treat every client's business like it is our own. That means no wasted spend, no fluff reports, and no excuses.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Kevin Freeland, Founder</figcaption>
      </figure>
